- DEC-24 four roles EXTRACT/PURSUE/FIND/CHECK; "machine may do the LOOKING; member does the CONCLUDING"; rule 2 machine may not choose question.
- DEC-55: AI is agent against endpoint surface; own ai class token; minting is member act; "A skill is instructions; a fence is code".
- DEC-60: session formulates claims as suggestions; machine may not accept. DEC-61/113: transcripts device-local, TTL, deleted at publication; never in record. DEC-62 one session. DEC-63 run spends group's Claude budget; project membership gate (amended Bob 2026-09-18 anybody can ask any question - MA src 991-995).
- DEC-90 assistant panel docked; machine-work treatment; "the assistant did this, at <member>'s request"; expandable for long answer/table.
- DEC-120 wizard scripts run without AI/key; with key the assistant may plan a flow; DEC-121 assistant expert script author. DEC-125.3 assistant says "I", never "we"; "neutral on policy", "honest about limits".
